The skill is not here.

It lives at ../skills/sumibako/SKILL.md, which is where `npx skills add` looks
and where the Agent Skills specification says it belongs - the directory name
has to match the skill's name.

A second copy in this directory would be found first and installed instead,
carrying index.mjs and package.json into your agent's skills folder with it.
That happened once. Do not add one back.

Both this directory and the skill are generated by scripts/build-skill-repo.mjs
in the Sumibako repository. Edit cli/SKILL.md there.
